{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":248,"title":"19. Chaṭṭhavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvakānaṁ upāsakānaṁ paṭhamaṁ saraṇaṁ gacchantānaṁ yadidaṁ tapussabhallikā vāṇijā."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Dāyakānaṁ yadidaṁ sudatto gahapati anāthapiṇḍiko."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Dhammakathikānaṁ yadidaṁ citto gahapati macchikāsaṇḍiko."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Catūhi saṅgahavatthūhi parisaṁ saṅgaṇhantānaṁ yadidaṁ hatthako āḷavako."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Paṇītadāyakānaṁ yadidaṁ mahānāmo sakko."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Manāpadāyakānaṁ yadidaṁ uggo gahapati vesāliko."},
{"v":"7","t":"… Saṅghupaṭṭhākānaṁ yadidaṁ hatthigāmako uggato gahapati."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Aveccappasannānaṁ yadidaṁ sūrambaṭṭho."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Puggalappasannānaṁ yadidaṁ jīvako komārabhacco."},
{"v":"10","t":"… Vissāsakānaṁ yadidaṁ nakulapitā gahapatī”ti. Vaggo chaṭṭho."}
]}
